------------------------------------------------------------------------
  year        age  success    total     rate
  2022          1       80      680    11.8%
  2021          2      121     1368     8.8%
  2020          3      231     3670     6.3%
  2019          4      267     1549    17.2%
  2018          5      208     1283    16.2%
  2017          6       75      666    11.3%
  2016          7       51      420    12.1%
  2015          8       60      235    25.5%
  2014          9       27      317     8.5%
  2013         10       69      141    48.9%
  TOTAL               1189    10329    11.5%
  Cochran-Armitage trend z = +11.42  (two-sided p = 3.49e-30)
  logistic slope on age    = +0.1604  (SE 0.0142, z = +11.27)  -> OR per year = 1.174
  between-cohort heterogeneity chi2 = 427.6 on 9 df (a pure binomial would give ~9)
  Spearman(age, rate) rho = +0.418  (n=10, unweighted -- shown for shape only)

